          </p>

          <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 my-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#38BDF8] mb-4">Approximate cost per 25 g of protein, large tubs</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
